WEBVTT

00:07:27.126 --> 00:07:30.157
Hiyo ni nafasi tunayopewa.

00:07:30.157 --> 00:07:33.763
Kujifunza,kuumia,kusimama,

00:07:33.763 --> 00:07:36.133
nafasi hizi zote tunapewa,

00:07:36.133 --> 00:07:37.639
lakini ni nafasi,

00:07:37.639 --> 00:07:39.298
na wote wanaozitumia

00:07:39.298 --> 00:07:41.515
nafasi hizo

00:07:41.515 --> 00:07:43.642
ndiyo tunaowathamini.

00:07:43.642 --> 00:07:45.729
Wanafanya kitu katika maisha.

00:07:45.729 --> 00:07:50.817
Na wale wanaofeli wanapata nafasi nyingine.

00:07:50.817 --> 00:07:53.240
Siku zote tunapata nafasi nyingine.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:58.272
Huo ndo uzuri wa maisha.

00:07:58.272 --> 00:08:02.763
Kwa hiyo ni jinsi gani tunatafuta namna